299	 * Reads `config.json`, sets or removes a single top-level field, and writes the
300	 * file back via `writeJsonFile()`. All other fields — including `_instructions`
301	 * — are preserved.
302	 *
303	 * @param field - The top-level key to modify (e.g. `"gitCredentials"`).
